# MyFamily — Architecture

## 1. Tech Stack
- **Flutter** (latest stable)
- **State management:** Riverpod (hooks_riverpod)
- **Routing:** go_router
- **Data:** Firebase Auth, Firestore, Functions, Storage, Messaging, App Check
- **UI/Responsive:** Material 3, flutter_screenutil, responsive_framework, auto_size_text
- **Local cache:** Hive or SharedPreferences
- **Testing:** flutter_test, golden_toolkit

