## 3. Firestore Schema
/users/{uid}
displayName, photoURL, email, families[], createdAt

/families/{familyId}
name, createdBy, members[], createdAt, themePref, points

/families/{familyId}/members/{uid}
role, avatar, points, notificationTokens[]

/families/{familyId}/tasks/{taskId}
title, desc, assignee, status, dueAt, repeat, points, createdBy, createdAt

/families/{familyId}/events/{eventId}
title, desc, startAt, endAt, attendees[], color

/families/{familyId}/groceryMasters/{masterId}
name, store, createdBy
/families/{familyId}/groceryMasters/{masterId}/items/{itemId}
name, category, defaultQty, notes

/families/{familyId}/groceryTrips/{tripId}
masterRef, assignee, store, status, startedAt, completedAt
/families/{familyId}/groceryTrips/{tripId}/items/{itemId}
name, category, qty, notes, checked

/families/{familyId}/activity/{activityId}
type, refId, actorUid, deltaPoints, createdAt


## 4. Cloud Functions
- onTaskCompleted → add points.
- onTripCompleted → add points, log activity.
- onInviteCreated → generate deep link.
- onUserDelete → anonymize.

## 5. Security
- Restrict access to families where `uid ∈ members`.
- Points only updated via Functions.

## 6. Navigation
- Root tabs: Home, Tasks, Groceries, Calendar, Profile.
- Use go_router for nested routing and deep links.

## 7. Theming
- Light/Dark/System switch.
- Seeded Material 3 color scheme.
- Clamp `textScaleFactor` globally (0.9–1.3).

## 8. Responsiveness
- `ScreenUtilInit(designSize: Size(390, 844))`.
- Breakpoints: MOBILE ≤450, TABLET ≤800, DESKTOP ≥801.
- LayoutBuilder for adaptive components.

## 9. Offline Sync
- Firestore offline persistence enabled.
- Optimistic updates + rollback.

## 10. Analytics
- Firebase Analytics + Crashlytics.
- Log: task_created, trip_completed, template_used.

## 11. CI/CD
- Flutter analyze/test → build → deploy (fastlane, Firebase App Distribution).

